Third-party components

The models this project downloads are not covered by the licence above. They
are redistributed by their own projects under their own terms:

  YuNet, SFace      https://github.com/opencv/opencv_zoo        Apache-2.0
  MiniFASNet V2 SE  https://github.com/facenox/face-antispoof-onnx

The optional NPU graph (models/npu/sface_int8.nb) is a build artifact derived
from the SFace model and is not committed to this repository.

The Allwinner VIPLite runtime (libVIPlite.so, libVIPuser.so) comes from
Allwinner's public SDK at https://gitlab.com/tina5.0_aiot/ai-sdk and is used
under its own terms.
